`maximum_payload_bytes()` (:126-144) uses `checked_add` for both the value sum
and the value+bitmap sum, and compares against
`MAX_VALUE_BYTES=256 / MAX_NULL_BYTES=2 / MAX_PAYLOAD_BYTES=258`. Every arm
returns `Err(String)` with an `EC_GENERATION_DESCRIPTOR:` prefix. No `unwrap`,
